OL,3,GNEWSAOn duty PC offered to pick up
OL,4,Avulnerable teenage girl for sex
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who made sexual
OL,7,Fcomments to a vulnerable 17-year-old
OL,8,Fgirl and tried to touch her while
OL,9,Fcarrying out a welfare check has been
OL,10,Fjailed.
OL,12,FMerseyside Police constable Carl
OL,13,FEdwards spent 90 minutes alone with the
OL,14,Fhigh-risk missing teenager in a
OL,15,Fbedroom, where he offered to pick her
OL,16,Fup after finishing work.
OL,18,FAn investigation also found Edwards had
OL,19,Fpropositioned two sex workers,
OL,20,Fincluding one who had approached him to
OL,21,Freport an assault.
